  "notes": "Cash-basis county, governmental funds only. Statement lines from Exhibit D Total Governmental Funds column (p4); Federal Grants line prints 0 and is omitted. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet - Cash Basis (p3; totals equal the Statement of Net Position, p1, where the 20,251 is labelled Designated Deposits). Ending cash = Equity in Pooled Cash 5,248,976 and investments = Designated Investments 20,251 (p3); no beginning cash printed (beginning fund balance 5,119,628). Roll: 5,119,628 + 3,530,854 - 3,381,255 + 876,903 - 876,903 = 5,269,227. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (pp5-6) by department; its Taxes 2,077,873 split into Property Taxes 1,987,677 + Motor Vehicle Tax 90,196 from the General column of Exhibit D (p4); its State 22,783 / Local 421,652 and the Road Fund's State 569,878 / Local 179,341 do not tie to Exhibit D's columns (10,188 and 5 reclassified between intergovernmental and local), so kept as printed. Inheritance Tax Fund 'Local' 49,716 is printed as Inheritance Tax on Exhibit D. Nonmajor funds from the combining schedules (pp9-11), one line per fund column; the nonmajor budget schedule (Schedule 4, pp12-14) prints only fund totals and is not recorded (no double counting). Noxious Weed is natural resources/conservation. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
